+    '',
+    '## The KV storage format is what makes 1M + MTP startable (measured 2026-10-15)',
+    '  The device pool is (B+R) x lanes. With B=32768 / R=5632 / 1 lane / --spec mtp',
+    '  and a 1M context, each format gave:',
+    '    bf16   3.18 GiB reserved -> REFUSED (only 2.755 GiB free after weights)',
+    '    int8   1.79 GiB reserved -> free 845 MiB   PPL 5.85541  (+0.00044 vs bf16)',
+    '    fp8    1.76 GiB reserved -> free 847 MiB   PPL 5.85575  (+0.00078)',
+    '    rk8v4  1.50 GiB reserved -> free 1.09 GiB  PPL 5.86005  (+0.00508)',
+    '    k8v4   1.48 GiB reserved -> free 1.09 GiB',
+    '  bf16 PPL = 5.85497 (124/124 windows, 261,223 tokens, zero [ALIGN] lines).',
+    '  The delivery therefore sets --kv-dtype int8: the full 1M context runs with MTP',
+    '  on, and its accuracy differs from bf16 by less than the run-to-run spread.',
+    '  With int8 the visible window can be raised to about 67200 tokens per lane.',
+    '',
+    '## Startup errors now name the limit (2026-10-15)',
+    '  A plan that does not fit reports the window it would need, the window the card',
+    '  can start, and the knob to turn. Example (bf16 + MTP + the 38400 window):',
+    '    "... this budget admits at most the minimum Main-KV capacity of 600 page',
+    '     group(s). It needs 3417107200 bytes and 2955935744 are free after weights,',
+    '     so the largest visible window this configuration can start is about 31744',
+    '     tokens per lane (B + R); lower --kvmem-budget to about 26112 with R = 5632',
+    '     and the same bf16 KV. Alternatively use a narrower --kv-dtype, or drop',
+    '     --spec mtp, whose routing state adds a fixed reservation."',
+    '',
+    '## Measured on this machine (2026-10-15)',
+    '  capacity        B+R = 38400 tokens, 600/600 pages (int8, MTP on)',
+    '  decode          int8 + MTP 76.2 tok/s; int8 without MTP 44.9 (MTP pays ~+70%)',
+    '  prefill (32K)   int8 + MTP 614 tok/s (bf16 without MTP 469)',
+    '  prefill (128K)  236.9 tok/s across pages (window 38400 vs a 121,705-token prompt)',
+    '  recall 128K     12/12 scattered records returned with the window at 38400 AND at',
