+    '    0-30 MiB used. The warning follows the graph-profile set, not only B.',
+    '  - host KV is ordinary heap memory, so it can be paged out under pressure;',
+    '    locking it (VirtualLock / cudaHostAlloc) is designed but not implemented.',
+    '  - ActKV: the LRFU keep score now admits only positive evidence and is floored at',
